 "licence_notes": [], "limitations": ["Requires the optional transformers library (the network is its `Owlv2ForObjectDetection`).", "The original in the benchmarks and goldens is the Hugging Face transformers 5.19.0 port with the authors' weights (google/owlv2-*-ensemble); the official scenic (JAX) code was not run.", "Text queries are used as given (no prompt templates or prompt ensembling as in the paper's COCO / LVIS numbers); each is cut to 16 tokens as the transformers processor does.", "No objectness scores and no image-guided (one-shot) detection.", "One box per patch token (3600 for B/16, 5184 for L/14) without NMS, as the original post-processing; overlapping boxes of the same object are common at low thresholds."], "task_io": "Input: one RGB image. Output: boxes, class labels, scores and instance masks.", "install": {"extras": [], "noncommercial_weights": []}, "variants": [{"id": "owlv2-b16", "released": null, "added_in": "0.2.0", "ref": "owlv2-b16@1", "name": "owlv2-b16", "setting": "", "default_tag": false, "params": {}, "licence": {"code": "Apache-2.0", "code_class": "permissive", "weights": "Apache-2.0", "weights_assumed": false, "evidence": "https://huggingface.co/google/owlv2-base-patch16-ensemble/blob/cfd3195ba4ea9592eec887ded089f4c08eff231d/README.md", "training_data": [{"id": "webli", "name": "WebLI (Google web image-text data, not released)", "licence": "not stated", "commercial": "unclear", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.15343"}, {"id": "objects365", "name": "Objects365 (train, box annotations)", "licence": "CC-BY-4.0", "commercial": "no", "url": "https://www.objects365.org/download.html"}], "training_note": "Self-training on WebLI image-text pairs with pseudo-boxes from an OWL-ViT annotator (itself trained on Objects365 and Visual Genome), then the weight ensemble of that model and its fine-tune on Objects365 + Visual Genome; Visual Genome has no dataset id here (OWLv2 paper, arXiv:2306.09683; the ensemble checkpoints).", "commercial": "yes